<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Deckungsbeitrags-Analyse - {{formatDate reportDate "DD.MM.YYYY"}}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #6f42c1;
            color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .kpi-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .kpi-box {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            border-left: 4px solid #6f42c1;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .kpi-number {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #6f42c1;
        }
        .kpi-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        .positive { color: #28a745; }
        .negative { color: #dc3545; }
        .neutral { color: #6c757d; }
        .table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 15px 0;
            background-color: white;
        }
        .table th,
        .table td {
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .table th {
            background-color: #6f42c1;
            color: white;
        }
        .margin-high {
            background-color: #d4edda !important;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .margin-medium {
            background-color: #fff3cd !important;
        }
        .margin-low {
            background-color: #f8d7da !important;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        .section {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .alert {
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .alert-success {
            background-color: #d4edda;
            border: 1px solid #c3e6cb;
            color: #155724;
        }
        .alert-warning {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            border: 1px solid #ffeaa7;
            color: #856404;
        }
        .alert-danger {
            background-color: #f8d7da;
            border: 1px solid #f5c6cb;
            color: #721c24;
        }
        .progress-bar {
            width: 100%;
            height: 20px;
            background-color: #e9ecef;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        .progress-fill {
            height: 100%;
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }
        .progress-high { background-color: #28a745; }
        .progress-medium { background-color: #ffc107; }
        .progress-low { background-color: #dc3545; }
        .margin-indicator {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin-right: 5px;
        }
        .indicator-high { background-color: #28a745; }
        .indicator-medium { background-color: #ffc107; }
        .indicator-low { background-color: #dc3545; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>💰 Deckungsbeitrags-Analyse</h1>
        <p>Rentabilitätsbericht vom {{formatDate reportDate "DD.MM.YYYY"}}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <div class="kpi-grid">
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{overallMargin}}%</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Gesamtmarge</div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{totalMarginValue}} €</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Gesamtdeckungsbeitrag</div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{averageMargin}}%</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Durchschnittsmarge</div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{profitableProducts}}</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Profitable Produkte</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {{#if alerts}}
        <div class="alert {{#if criticalMargins}}alert-danger{{else if lowMargins}}alert-warning{{else}}alert-success{{/if}}">
            <h4>📊 Margin-Status:</h4>
            <ul>
                {{#each alerts}}
                <li>{{this}}</li>
                {{/each}}
            </ul>
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        <div class="section">
            <h3>🏆 Top 15 Produkte nach Deckungsbeitrag</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Rang</th>
                        <th>Produkt</th>
                        <th>Verkaufspreis</th>
                        <th>Einkaufspreis</th>
                        <th>Marge</th>
                        <th>DB/Stück</th>
                        <th>Verkäufe</th>
                        <th>Gesamt-DB</th>
                        <th>Trend</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each topMarginProducts}}
                    <tr class="{{#if (gte marginPercent 40)}}margin-high{{else if (gte marginPercent 20)}}margin-medium{{else}}margin-low{{/if}}">
                        <td>{{add @index 1}}</td>
                        <td>
                            <span class="margin-indicator {{#if (gte marginPercent 40)}}indicator-high{{else if (gte marginPercent 20)}}indicator-medium{{else}}indicator-low{{/if}}"></span>
                            {{productName}}
                        </td>
                        <td>{{sellingPrice}} €</td>
                        <td>{{costPrice}} €</td>
                        <td>{{marginPercent}}%</td>
                        <td>{{marginPerUnit}} €</td>
                        <td>{{unitsSold}}</td>
                        <td>{{totalMargin}} €</td>
                        <td class="{{#if (gt trend 0)}}positive{{else if (lt trend 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}">
                            {{#if (gt trend 0)}}📈{{else if (lt trend 0)}}📉{{else}}➡️{{/if}}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>⚠️ Kritische Margen (unter 10%)</h3>
            {{#if lowMarginProducts}}
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Produkt</th>
                        <th>Verkaufspreis</th>
                        <th>Einkaufspreis</th>
                        <th>Aktuelle Marge</th>
                        <th>Empfohlener Preis</th>
                        <th>Verkäufe (7 Tage)</th>
                        <th>Maßnahme</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each lowMarginProducts}}
                    <tr class="margin-low">
                        <td>{{productName}}</td>
                        <td>{{sellingPrice}} €</td>
                        <td>{{costPrice}} €</td>
                        <td>{{marginPercent}}%</td>
                        <td>{{recommendedPrice}} €</td>
                        <td>{{recentSales}}</td>
                        <td>
                            {{#if (lt marginPercent 0)}}
                                🔴 Verlust - Sofort überprüfen
                            {{else if (lt marginPercent 5)}}
                                🟠 Preisanpassung dringend
                            {{else}}
                                🟡 Preisüberprüfung
                            {{/if}}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
            {{else}}
            <div class="alert alert-success">
                ✅ Ausgezeichnet! Alle Produkte haben eine Marge von mindestens 10%.
            </div>
            {{/if}}
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>📊 Margen-Verteilung nach Kategorien</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Kategorie</th>
                        <th>Ø Marge</th>
                        <th>Deckungsbeitrag</th>
                        <th>Produktanzahl</th>
                        <th>Umsatzanteil</th>
                        <th>Bewertung</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each categoryMargins}}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{categoryName}}</td>
                        <td>{{averageMargin}}%</td>
                        <td>{{totalContribution}} €</td>
                        <td>{{productCount}}</td>
                        <td>
                            {{revenueShare}}%
                            <div class="progress-bar">
                                <div class="progress-fill progress-{{#if (gte averageMargin 30)}}high{{else if (gte averageMargin 15)}}medium{{else}}low{{/if}}" style="width: {{revenueShare}}%;"></div>
                            </div>
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            {{#if (gte averageMargin 30)}}
                                ✅ Ausgezeichnet
                            {{else if (gte averageMargin 15)}}
                                ⚠️ Befriedigend
                            {{else}}
                                🔴 Verbesserung nötig
                            {{/if}}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>🏪 Standort-Margen-Analyse</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Standort</th>
                        <th>Ø Marge</th>
                        <th>Gesamtdeckungsbeitrag</th>
                        <th>Umsatz</th>
                        <th>Beste Marge</th>
                        <th>Schlechteste Marge</th>
                        <th>Status</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each locationMargins}}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{locationName}}</td>
                        <td>{{averageMargin}}%</td>
                        <td>{{totalContribution}} €</td>
                        <td>{{revenue}} €</td>
                        <td>{{bestMargin}}%</td>
                        <td>{{worstMargin}}%</td>
                        <td>
                            {{#if (gte averageMargin 25)}}
                                ✅ Sehr gut
                            {{else if (gte averageMargin 15)}}
                                ⚠️ OK
                            {{else}}
                                🔴 Optimierung nötig
                            {{/if}}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>📈 Margen-Entwicklung (letzte 4 Wochen)</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Kalenderwoche</th>
                        <th>Durchschnittsmarge</th>
                        <th>Gesamtdeckungsbeitrag</th>
                        <th>Veränderung</th>
                        <th>Trend</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each weeklyTrend}}
                    <tr {{#if isCurrent}}class="margin-high"{{/if}}>
                        <td>KW {{weekNumber}}</td>
                        <td>{{averageMargin}}%</td>
                        <td>{{totalContribution}} €</td>
                        <td class="{{#if (gt change 0)}}positive{{else if (lt change 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}">
                            {{#if (gt change 0)}}+{{/if}}{{change}}%
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            {{#if (gt change 2)}}
                                📈 Stark steigend
                            {{else if (gt change 0)}}
                                📊 Leicht steigend
                            {{else if (lt change -2)}}
                                📉 Stark fallend
                            {{else if (lt change 0)}}
                                📊 Leicht fallend
                            {{else}}
                                ➡️ Stabil
                            {{/if}}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        {{#if recommendations}}
        <div class="section" style="border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;">
            <h3>📋 Handlungsempfehlungen</h3>
            <div class="alert alert-warning">
                <h4>🎯 Prioritäre Maßnahmen:</h4>
                <ul>
                    {{#each recommendations.priority}}
                    <li><strong>{{this}}</strong></li>
                    {{/each}}
                </ul>
            </div>
            <h4>💡 Weitere Optimierungen:</h4>
            <ul>
                {{#each recommendations.general}}
                <li>{{this}}</li>
                {{/each}}
            </ul>
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        <div class="section">
            <h3>🎯 Zielmargen und Benchmarks</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Kategorie</th>
                        <th>Ist-Marge</th>
                        <th>Ziel-Marge</th>
                        <th>Gap</th>
                        <th>Potenzial</th>
                        <th>Status</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each targetMargins}}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{category}}</td>
                        <td>{{currentMargin}}%</td>
                        <td>{{targetMargin}}%</td>
                        <td class="{{#if (gt gap 0)}}negative{{else}}positive{{/if}}">
                            {{gap}}%
                        </td>
                        <td>{{potential}} €</td>
                        <td>
                            {{#if (gte currentMargin targetMargin)}}
                                ✅ Ziel erreicht
                            {{else if (gte currentMargin (subtract targetMargin 5))}}
                                ⚠️ Nahe am Ziel
                            {{else}}
                                🔴 Verbesserung nötig
                            {{/if}}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>Dieser Bericht wurde automatisch vom Proviantomat-System generiert.</p>
        <p>Analysezeitraum: {{formatDate startDate "DD.MM.YYYY"}} - {{formatDate endDate "DD.MM.YYYY"}}</p>
        <p>Generiert am: {{formatDate sentAt "DD.MM.YYYY HH:mm"}} (Europe/Berlin)</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>